WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.401 --> 00:00:09.659
I am black and white.

2
00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:11.336
I give milk.

3
00:00:11.337 --> 00:00:14.700
Guess who I am.

4
00:00:14.701 --> 00:00:19.756
It's me, the cow!

5
00:00:19.757 --> 00:00:22.291
I can fly a little.

6
00:00:22.292 --> 00:00:23.775
I lay eggs.

7
00:00:23.776 --> 00:00:26.995
Guess who I am.

8
00:00:26.996 --> 00:00:32.364
It's me, the hen!

9
00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:34.167
I eat hay.

10
00:00:34.168 --> 00:00:36.668
I can run very fast.

11
00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:40.047
Guess who I am.

12
00:00:40.048 --> 00:00:45.135
It's me, the horse!

13
00:00:45.136 --> 00:00:47.747
I have a curly tail.

14
00:00:47.748 --> 00:00:49.784
I like mud.

15
00:00:49.785 --> 00:00:53.249
Guess who I am.

16
00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:58.883
It's me, the pig!

17
00:00:58.884 --> 00:01:00.955
I bury bones.

18
00:01:00.956 --> 00:01:03.412
I chase cats.

19
00:01:03.413 --> 00:01:07.084
Guess who I am.

20
00:01:07.085 --> 00:01:12.682
It's me, the dog!

21
00:01:12.683 --> 00:01:14.956
I give wool.

22
00:01:14.957 --> 00:01:17.446
I say, "Baa."

23
00:01:17.447 --> 00:01:20.482
Guess who I am.

24
00:01:20.483 --> 00:01:25.678
It's me, the sheep!

25
00:01:25.679 --> 00:01:27.648
I have horns.

26
00:01:27.649 --> 00:01:29.862
I eat anything.

27
00:01:29.863 --> 00:01:32.638
Guess who I am.

28
00:01:32.639 --> 00:01:38.223
It's me, the billy goat!

29
00:01:38.224 --> 00:01:41.444
I feed everyone on the farm.

30
00:01:41.445 --> 00:01:44.581
Guess who I am.

31
00:01:44.582 --> 00:01:50.818
It's me, the farmer!
